{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0462_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2773cecd91a051191b1c80debd783d5ab165849f787d2dbe0b3acdd17a3133d0", "ja": "（パジャマパーティーの撮影がとても楽しかったのか\n劇場へ帰る道中も環は上機嫌だ！）", "zh": "（拍摄睡衣派对似乎让环特别开心，回剧场的路上也一直兴致高涨！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0462_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "6c01528beb3aef5f0dc5e44c0239f5da07f4c861fdfe79a7afd6c6ba8895e1d8", "ja": "おやぶん、おやぶん。\n今日みたいなパーティーって次はいつできるかな？", "zh": "老大，老大。\n像今天这样的派对，下次什么时候还能再办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0462_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "6e8e050b8a2720a93e826a74aa396fdaae44be0b8424dff5a6361f85eddb16e5", "ja": "たまきね、劇場のみんなと一緒に、トランプしたり\nたくさんお話したり、それからそれから……。", "zh": "环呢，和剧场的大家一起玩扑克牌，\n还聊了好多好多，然后还有然后还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
