{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0462_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2420affd9e4bcfec633268d00bce82b591f652d1882693d96f19b18cfaa9abb6", "ja": "途中で寝ちゃった時は焦ったよ……。でも、\nあの楽しそうな寝言は、夢の中で遊んでたからか。", "zh": "你中途睡着的时候，可把我吓了一跳……不过，你那副开心的梦话，原来是因为在梦里玩耍啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0462_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "2d325bdb107fb2f53b33c17e9480f1977413ae11181f3b9abf9cbb1230e79aca", "ja": "うん！　でもそっか～。夢か……。\nたまき、もっとみんなと遊びたかったのにな……。", "zh": "嗯！不过原来是这样啊～梦吗……\n环，你本来还想和大家多玩一会儿的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0462_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d618c503457f5d05e5fef38676e96485e3f19e3aa8c68a606b5fbd1c92fe5d6c", "ja": "……よし、わかった。\nパジャマパーティーができるように、考えておくよ。", "zh": "……好，我知道了。\n我会想办法，让大家能办睡衣派对的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0462_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "fc24e82017da6bcc8655c9f2b9d9cc7c053f755ebb6b9972709364b6db45ee4e", "ja": "わ～い！　ありがとう、おやぶん！　たまき、今度は\n最後まで起きてられるように頑張るね！", "zh": "哇～！谢谢你，大头领！环，今后会努力坚持到最后不睡着的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
